## Root Causes Identified

1. **Artificial Blocking Loading Screen ([`src/App.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/mohamed%20imran/Desktop/nextal_academy%20-%20Copy/src/App.jsx#L84-L111))**:
   - `App.jsx` enforces a minimum display timer of 800ms to 1500ms (on throttled network) plus a 700ms CSS fade-out transition for `<LoadingScreen />`.
   - Because `.gpm-loader` is a fixed opaque overlay (`position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 99999; background: #0b0718`), it hides the hero text and header from Lighthouse and real users, delaying FCP to 4.7s and LCP to 6.1s.
   - Directly violates the user constraint: *"DO NOT artificially delay the entire page / add fake loading screens"*.

2. **Render-Blocking Main CSS (`dist/assets/index-*.css`)**:
   - The compiled stylesheet (76 KB / 15 KB gzip) is linked as a standard render-blocking `<link rel="stylesheet">`, preventing the browser from painting critical hero elements until the file is fully downloaded.

3. **Sub-optimal 3D Trigger in [`src/components/Hero.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/mohamed%20imran/Desktop/nextal_academy%20-%20Copy/src/components/Hero.jsx#L25-L48)**:
   - Currently waits for user interaction (mouse move/scroll) with a fallback timeout of 4000ms. In automated audits or for passive users, the doll is delayed for 4 full seconds.
   - The correct behavior requested by the user is: **Critical page content renders instantly → fast LCP → schedule 3D scene loading via `requestIdleCallback` → doll appears quickly**.

4. **Continuous WebGL RAF & Viewport Leaks ([`src/components/HeroScene.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/mohamed%20imran/Desktop/nextal_academy%20-%20Copy/src/components/HeroScene.jsx#L72-L77))**:
   - The Three.js WebGL canvas runs an unthrottled `useFrame` animation loop indefinitely, even when the user scrolls down to the footer or when the browser tab is hidden.
   - Canvas does not configure `frameloop="demand"` or pause when off-screen.

5. **External Draco Decoders & Heavy HDR Asset**:
   - [`src/components/Robot_cat.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/mohamed%20imran/Desktop/nextal_academy%20-%20Copy/src/components/Robot_cat.jsx#L17) fetches Draco decoders from `https://www.gstatic.com/draco/v1/decoders/` (cross-origin DNS, TLS, and network latency).
   - [`public/potsdamer_platz_1k.hdr`](file:///c:/Users/mohamed%20imran/Desktop/nextal_academy%20-%20Copy/public/potsdamer_platz_1k.hdr) is **1.54 MB**, which is downloaded over the network every time the 3D scene loads.

6. **Below-the-Fold Unthrottled Physics Loop ([`src/components/WhyUs.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/mohamed%20imran/Desktop/nextal_academy%20-%20Copy/src/components/WhyUs.jsx#L132-L240))**:
   - `WhyUs.jsx` runs a continuous `requestAnimationFrame` spring physics loop updating 7 cards and lines, consuming main-thread CPU time even while the user is at the top of the page.

